{"type":"text","timestamp":1794047999946,"sessionID":"ses_e4a6faf75ffeWknnGBCeXJ18Fc","part":{"id":"prt_1b597c11a001Fh8D12mHYtomt9","messageID":"msg_1b596e9f4001IxjHy9zZ48zx0I","sessionID":"ses_e4a6faf75ffeWknnGBCeXJ18Fc","type":"text","text":"\n\n## Objective\n- Create `ledgerkit/limiter.py` with a thread-safe `TokenBucket(rate, capacity, clock=time.monotonic)` (lazy capped refill, clock-rewind handling, float-exact affordability) and add tests in `tests/test_limiter.py`; run `python3 -m pytest -q` and commit to the current branch.\n\n## Important Details\n- Working dir `/home/user/latte-crew/var/worktrees/1107-41e94c` (git worktree; only commit `92fe8b0 init`). Stay inside this dir; never push or switch branches; report the test command + actual result.\n- Environment: Python 3.12.3, pytest 7.4.4. README says run tests with `python3 -m pytest -q`.\n- API: starts full; `try_acquire(n=1)` → True and takes n if available, else False and takes nothing; `wait_time(n=1)` → seconds until n available (0.0 if available now), takes nothing.\n- ValueError: constructor raises for `rate <= 0` / `capacity <= 0`; both methods raise for `n <= 0` / `n > capacity`.\n- Refill is lazy and capped at capacity.\n- Clock goes backwards: no tokens added/removed; resync internal `_time` to the new (earlier) time so later refill is measured from the new time (no lost refill).\n- Float precision: naive `tokens + elapsed*rate` can deny exactly-affordable requests (e.g. rate=3: `(1/3)*3 = 0.9999999999999999 < 1`); `try_acquire(n)` must succeed after waiting exactly `wait_time(n)` from an empty bucket over thousands of cycles at rates 0.1, 3, 7.\n- Chosen fix: relative tolerance in the affordability check (`self._tokens + tol >= n`, tol ≈ 1e-8 * capacity). Fraction and fsum exact-arithmetic alternatives were analyzed and rejected as over-engineered.\n- Thread safety: single `threading.Lock` around refill + check-and-take so N threads never over-acquire; total overshoot bounded by tol. Validate `n` before acquiring the lock.\n- Conventions: `ledgerkit/__init__.py` is empty; modules are minimal; tests import directly (e.g. `from ledgerkit.money import split`).\n\n## Work State\n### Completed\n- Explored repo: `ledgerkit/money.py`, `ledgerkit/__init__.py` (empty), `tests/test_money.py`, `README.md`.\n- Verified tool versions (Python 3.12.3, pytest 7.4.4).\n- Full float-error analysis done (error grows ~linearly + a K² clock-coarseness term; relative-tolerance approach selected).\n- Designed class structure, refill logic, and full test plan.\n\n### Active\n- About to write `ledgerkit/limiter.py` and `tests/test_limiter.py`.\n- No files created/modified and no commits yet (only `92fe8b0 init`).\n\n### Blocked\n- `mkdir -p /tmp/opencode/limiter-proto` was denied by external-directory permission rules — cannot prototype in /tmp; do the work inside the worktree instead.\n\n## Next Move\n1. Write `ledgerkit/limiter.py`: `TokenBucket` with validated constructor (starts full, `_time = clock()`), `_refill(now)` handling rewind, and locked `try_acquire`/`wait_time` using relative-tolerance affordability.\n2. Write `tests/test_limiter.py`: `FakeClock`; basic acquire/wait/cap; ValueError cases; clock-rewind (no add/remove + no lost refill); multi-cycle exact affordability over rates 0.1/3/7; thread-safety with frozen clock asserting exact total.\n3. Run `python3 -m pytest -q` and capture the actual result.\n4. If green, commit to the current branch with a clear message (do not push).\n\n## Relevant Files\n- `/home/user/latte-crew/var/worktrees/1107-41e94c/ledgerkit/limiter.py`: to create — `TokenBucket` implementation.\n- `/home/user/latte-crew/var/worktrees/1107-41e94c/tests/test_limiter.py`: to create — test suite.\n- `/home/user/latte-crew/var/worktrees/1107-41e94c/ledgerkit/money.py`: reference for module conventions.\n- `/home/user/latte-crew/var/worktrees/1107-41e94c/ledgerkit/__init__.py`: empty package init (nothing to export).\n- `/home/user/latte-crew/var/worktrees/1107-41e94c/README.md`: documents `python3 -m pytest -q`.","time":{"start":1794047983898,"end":1794047999943}}}
