{"type":"text","timestamp":1794048628914,"sessionID":"ses_e4a6faf75ffeWknnGBCeXJ18Fc","part":{"id":"prt_1b5a142d1001QH9mneIBM0ZXpQ","messageID":"msg_1b5a0c0f6001hM1sSsDsnlWKFr","sessionID":"ses_e4a6faf75ffeWknnGBCeXJ18Fc","type":"text","text":"\n\n## Objective\n- Implement a thread-safe `TokenBucket` in `ledgerkit/limiter.py`, add tests in `tests/test_limiter.py`, run `python3 -m pytest -q`, and commit to the current branch without pushing or switching branches.\n\n## Important Details\n- Working directory: `/home/user/latte-crew/var/worktrees/1107-41e94c`.\n- Re-verified state: branch `crew/1107-41e94c`, clean tree, only commit `92fe8b0 init`.\n- Directory check confirmed:\n  - `ledgerkit/` contains `__init__.py`, `money.py`\n  - `tests/` contains `test_money.py`\n- Environment: Python 3.12.3, pytest 7.4.4; README specifies tests with `python3 -m pytest -q`.\n- Required API:\n  - `TokenBucket(rate, capacity, clock=time.monotonic)`\n  - Bucket starts full.\n  - `try_acquire(n=1)`:\n    - returns `True` and consumes `n` if available\n    - returns `False` and consumes nothing otherwise\n  - `wait_time(n=1)`:\n    - returns seconds until `n` tokens are available\n    - returns `0.0` if already available\n    - consumes nothing\n- Validation:\n  - constructor raises `ValueError` for `rate <= 0` or `capacity <= 0`\n  - `try_acquire` and `wait_time` raise `ValueError` for `n <= 0` or `n > capacity`\n- Refill behavior:\n  - lazy refill on access\n  - capped at `capacity`\n  - if clock moves backward: no tokens added or removed, and internal time is reset to the new earlier time\n- Planned core implementation:\n  - `_EPS = 1e-6`\n  - store `float(rate)`, `float(capacity)`, clock, `_tokens = capacity`, `_time = clock()`, `_tol = _EPS * capacity`, and a `threading.Lock`\n  - `_refill(now)`:\n    - if `now < self._time`, set `self._time = now` and return\n    - otherwise add `min(capacity, tokens + (now - self._time) * rate)` and set `self._time = now`\n  - affordability check: `self._tokens + self._tol >= n`\n  - on successful `try_acquire`, clamp with `self._tokens = max(0.0, self._tokens - n)`\n- Thread-safety decisions:\n  - single lock around refill plus check-and-consume\n  - validate `n` before acquiring the lock\n  - tolerance must not permit integer over-acquisition in the frozen-clock thread test\n- Test plan:\n  - `FakeClock` with `__call__`, `advance(dt)`, and `set(t)`\n  - tests for:\n    - constructor validation\n    - invalid `n` validation\n    - starts full\n    - default `n=1`\n    - basic acquire/wait behavior\n    - `wait_time` does not consume\n    - failed `try_acquire` does not consume\n    - refill is capped\n    - backward clock does not refill\n    - exact affordability after `wait_time` for rates `[0.1, 3.0, 7.0]`, capacities `[1, 5, 100, 1000]`, 10,000 cycles each\n    - thread safety with frozen clock: 10 threads × 1000 attempts, capacity 100, total acquired exactly 100\n- Conventions:\n  - `ledgerkit/__init__.py` stays empty\n  - tests import directly: `from ledgerkit.limiter import TokenBucket`\n  - all work stays inside the worktree\n\n## Work State\n### Completed\n- Re-verified existing repo files and conventions:\n  - `/home/user/latte-crew/var/worktrees/1107-41e94c/ledgerkit/money.py`\n  - `/home/user/latte-crew/var/worktrees/1107-41e94c/ledgerkit/__init__.py`\n  - `/home/user/latte-crew/var/worktrees/1107-41e94c/tests/test_money.py`\n  - `/home/user/latte-crew/var/worktrees/1107-41e94c/README.md`\n- Re-verified git branch/status/log and directory contents.\n- Completed design for `TokenBucket` and the test suite.\n- Recorded active todos for implementation, tests, test run, and commit.\n\n### Active\n- About to create:\n  - `/home/user/latte-crew/var/worktrees/1107-41e94c/ledgerkit/limiter.py`\n  - `/home/user/latte-crew/var/worktrees/1107-41e94c/tests/test_limiter.py`\n- No files have been created or modified yet.\n- No new commits have been made.\n\n### Blocked\n- none\n\n## Next Move\n1. Write `/home/user/latte-crew/var/worktrees/1107-41e94c/ledgerkit/limiter.py` with the planned `TokenBucket` implementation.\n2. Write `/home/user/latte-crew/var/worktrees/1107-41e94c/tests/test_limiter.py` with the planned test suite.\n3. Run `python3 -m pytest -q` from `/home/user/latte-crew/var/worktrees/1107-41e94c`.\n4. If tests pass, stage `ledgerkit/limiter.py` and `tests/test_limiter.py`, commit to `crew/1107-41e94c`, and do not push or switch branches.\n\n## Relevant Files\n- `/home/user/latte-crew/var/worktrees/1107-41e94c/ledgerkit/limiter.py`: to create — `TokenBucket` implementation.\n- `/home/user/latte-crew/var/worktrees/1107-41e94c/tests/test_limiter.py`: to create — test suite for `TokenBucket`.\n- `/home/user/latte-crew/var/worktrees/1107-41e94c/ledgerkit/money.py`: reference for minimal module style.\n- `/home/user/latte-crew/var/worktrees/1107-41e94c/ledgerkit/__init__.py`: empty package init; no exports needed.\n- `/home/user/latte-crew/var/worktrees/1107-41e94c/tests/test_money.py`: reference for direct-import pytest style.\n- `/home/user/latte-crew/var/worktrees/1107-41e94c/README.md`: documents running tests with `python3 -m pytest -q`.","time":{"start":1794048606929,"end":1794048628911}}}
